 <frangarcj@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 27 Sep 2026 18:40:35 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Make scratch memory opt-in for dynamic and stream VBOs

With USE_SCRATCH_MEMORY, every GL_DYNAMIC_* and GL_STREAM_* buffer defaulted
to per-frame scratch storage, silently breaking apps that fill such a
buffer once and draw it over several frames. Default both to GL_FALSE so
the build flag is safe to enable globally; apps opt in with
vglSetupScratchMemory().

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 source/vgl.c    | 6 ++++--
 source/vitaGL.h | 2 +-
 2 files changed, 5 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

diff --git a/source/vgl.c b/source/vgl.c
index dedb88e..65e22f9 100644
--- a/source/vgl.c
+++ b/source/vgl.c
@@ -128,8 +128,10 @@ void update_scissor_test_uniforms(void) {
 #ifndef DISABLE_CIRCULAR_POOL
 #define CIRCULAR_POOL_SIZE_DEF (32 * 1024 * 1024) // Default size in bytes for the circular vertex pool
 #ifdef HAVE_SCRATCH_MEMORY
-GLboolean vgl_dynamic_wants_scratch = GL_TRUE;
-GLboolean vgl_stream_wants_scratch = GL_TRUE;
+// Opt-in: scratch storage only lives for the current frame, which breaks
+// apps that fill a dynamic/stream VBO once and draw it for several frames.
+GLboolean vgl_dynamic_wants_scratch = GL_FALSE;
+GLboolean vgl_stream_wants_scratch = GL_FALSE;
 #endif
 #ifndef CIRCULAR_POOL_SPEEDHACK
 uint8_t *circular_data_pool[DISPLAY_MAX_BUFFER_COUNT];
diff --git a/source/vitaGL.h b/source/vitaGL.h
index 84e6ead..ee95e46 100644
--- a/source/vitaGL.h
+++ b/source/vitaGL.h
@@ -1335,7 +1335,7 @@ void vglSetupGarbageCollector(int priority, int affinity);
 // Change the scenes per frame value to use for the display and fbos rendertargets. Default value: 1, 1.
 void vglSetupRenderTargetScenesNum(uint8_t display_size, uint8_t fbo_size);
 
-// Change what kind of vertex buffer objects are considered eligible for scratch memory usage in order to reduce allocation costs. Requires USE_SCRATCH_MEMORY.
+// Change what kind of vertex buffer objects are considered eligible for scratch memory usage in order to reduce allocation costs. Requires USE_SCRATCH_MEMORY. Default values: GL_FALSE, GL_FALSE.
 void vglSetupScratchMemory(GLboolean scratch_for_dynamic, GLboolean scratch_for_stream);
 
 // Setup the buffer sizes of the sceGxm shader patcher. Must be called before vglInit*. Default values: 1024 * 1024 each.
